## Quick Checklist for Code Generation

### Before Creating New Code

- [ ] Identify workflow: UI Test, Page+Action, or API Test
- [ ] Check golden files for pattern
- [ ] Reference `docs/ai-index.json` for existing similar code
- [ ] Plan file locations and class names

### During Generation (Cursor Tips)

- [ ] Reference specific file patterns: `@STAFTests/Actions/Login.cs`
- [ ] Ask Cursor to verify against rules in this file
- [ ] Specify constraints explicitly (no Thread.Sleep, etc.)
- [ ] Request XML comments on public methods

### After Generation

- [ ] Build: `dotnet build STAFTests/STAF.Selenium.Tests.csproj`
- [ ] Run tests: `dotnet test --filter "ClassName~YourClass"`
- [ ] Update `docs/ai-index.json`: `pwsh tools/UpdateAiIndex.ps1`
- [ ] Verify all public methods have XML comments
- [ ] Check inheritance (PageBaseClass, TestBaseClass, etc.)

